{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The proposed development, in conjunction with the\r\nlack of waste storage provision for the existing development, would be likely\r\nto result in inappropriate storage of waste and overspill of waste onto public\r\nareas, to the detriment of the health and safety of occupiers of the site and\r\nneighbouring occupiers and businesses, and would result in unacceptable impacts\r\nto the character and appearance of the property and the streetscene, contrary\r\nto policies T7 and D3.D(1) and D3.D(4) of The London Plan (2021),&amp;nbsp; policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), and&amp;nbsp; policies DM1, DM44 and DM45\r\nof the Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed cycle parking and refuse storage would be located on part of the Church Road highway network, which is adopted and publicly maintainable highway. This could result in a potential adverse impacts on pedestrian and highway safety, contrary to Policies D6, T4 and&amp;nbsp;T5 of The London Plan (2021) and policies DM42 and DM45 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposal, due to the shortfall in the bedroom\r\nsizes and the main living area, would represent a cramped and unsatisfactory\r\ninternal layout, to the detriment of the standard of living accommodation for\r\nfuture occupiers, contrary to Policy D6 of The London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.K\r\nof the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 the Development Management\r\nPolicies Local Plan (2013), and the Council’s adopted Residential Design Guide Supplementary\r\nPlanning Document (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
